んどん距離が近くなっちゃって、\n 最終的には二人の距離感マイナス5cmで\n 皆さんと握手してました🙃\n 沢山の方に近すぎって言われた（笑）\n \n \n なんかこの日の東村は本当にテンションが高くて、\n 笑い疲れました。あー楽しかった〜〜\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VVNJ1Y2MZP286T84YQVDQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VVPNX8FTSQQG2V39N5NF1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VVQRGKPZKCQV1GDF3BJCQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VVRSWF9736W9XSQ0HF6Y6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VVSVTKMVNMWEE650YDJ5A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VVTWS0BYH4DGQPPQGFJC9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1VVVY8K8CBA2ASZ0GVDGV3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n お花、本当に素敵なのをいつもありがとうございます！\n 4日はスター・ウォーズの日だったから\n スターウォーズ関連のお花も！嬉しい〜🧚‍♀️\n \n \n \n あ、\n アルバムの制作がついに始まりました！\n 楽しみにしててくださいね〜👼\n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-12737":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは( ∩ˇωˇ∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこでバンジーが玲香に\n決まった放送のあと、\n『桜井さん可哀想。\nかずみが飛べばよかったのに(笑)』\nと鬼畜なことを連絡してくる\n数名の幼なじみ達が\nいかつい。笑 \nそんな\n昨日(￣▽￣) "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NACK5 おに魂(ラジオ)終わった \n\nぜぜぜぜぜーいヽ(´>∀<`*)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん、鬼塚さん、\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2013/07/02/9311437/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいとゆったんと\n久しぶりのラジオ選抜で安心感\n半端なかったです(っ`∀´*)"},{"t